Proxmark / Chameleon (RFID Research Devices)
Advanced RFID research tools for reading, emulating, and analyzing cards.
Used in penetration testing of access control systems.
Helps evaluate encryption and cloning resistance.
⚠️ Use strictly in authorized lab/security testing scenarios.

Pandora / RF Signal Manipulation Devices
Hardware platforms for analyzing and manipulating radio signals.
Used in wireless protocol research and embedded security testing.
Supports studying RF communications and vulnerabilities.
⚠️ Interfering with radio systems may violate telecom laws.
